{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1531707-v20-light-sleeper","id":1531707,"title":"V20 Light Sleeper","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-28T16:12:12-08:00","id":1531707,"title":"V20 Light Sleeper","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> <br /> Is the merit <b>Light Sleeper</b> worth more for those that have dice pools larger than 10 (Methuselah's and other elders) and want to act during the day?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Effects of Humanity p. 311 V20 Core</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2022 Vampires sleep unnaturally deeply and are loath<br /> to rise even if presented with danger. Vampires with<br /> higher Humanity rise earlier in the evening than vam-<br /> pires with lower Humanity ratings. Also<b>, if a Kindred<br /> is forced to act during the day, the maximum dice pool<br /> he may employ for any action is equal to his Humanity<br /> rating.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>So maximum dice you can normally get to act during the day is 10, the top value for Humanity or Paths of Enlightment. If you get<b> Light Sleeper </b>however:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Light Sleeper p. 485 V20 Core</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can awaken instantly at any sign of trouble or<br /> danger, and do so without any sleepiness or hesitation.<br /> <b>You may ignore rules regarding how Humanity or your<br /> morality Path restricts the number of dice available<br /> during the day.\u200b</b><br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> So this merit is more valuable, the more dice you have... Am I wrong, or is there any other relevant fact about daytime actions and dice pools?<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-03T17:24:17-08:00","id":1531935,"title":"","content":"Yup, basically. It has value for those living on the run that may need to deal with day time intrusions.<br /> <br /> Also, for a Sabbat vamp converts to a Path, if I remember, they start at like 2-3 dots on Path and have to build up. So a Package could slap them around to wake them up earlier instead of letting them sleep half the night away.<br /> <br /> I've also seen Players use it for daytime Ops with Dominate5 and Animalism4.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25883-inspectorg","name":"InspectorG","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T15:53:23-07:00","id":1535806,"title":"","content":"Going by the inclinations in the lore, <i>Light Sleeper</i> is less likely for an older vampire to have, give or take some special cases. But it isn't in any way impossible.<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T16:12:35-07:00","id":1535808,"title":"","content":"1) You don't need to be low Generation to get 10+ dice pools, blood buffing, Potence, Celerity, etc. all get less useful if you're capped at X dice.<br /> <br /> 2) The ability to awakened reflexively and without a roll (even if they hid that somewhere outside of the base Humanity rules for reasons I cannot fathom) is useful even if you have a decent roll for it, because it's not a roll you want to fail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-28T17:52:53-07:00","id":1536476,"title":"","content":"Not much else I can add but I would think that having at least a humanity of 7 or greater should give you a bonus roll to wake up and stay active longer during the day and that younger kindred would have it easier to have such a merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}